    "text": "UNDER powers vested in me by Section 32(1) of the Provincial Council Act, No. 42 of 1987, I, K. C. Logeswaran, theGovernor of the Western Province, hereby notify that with effect from 26.01.2016, Mr. Parape Arachchige Asiri SandaruwanWeerasekara of the Sri Lanka Administrative Service Class III, has been appointed to assigned the duties as the WesternProvince Commissioner of the Co-operative Development and Registrar of the Co-operative Societies.",
